// Fragment DEPTH export, `out` PARAMETER spelling (t_1722b8bc).
//
// Same contract as fp_depth_export_f.cg, reached through a different
// container code path: a struct return and an `out` parameter list build
// the parameter table at two SEPARATE sites, and the depth output's
// CGtype widening had to be fixed in both.  Fixing only the site the
// struct fixture exercised left this spelling emitting CG_FLOAT, so this
// file exists to pin the site the other fixture cannot reach.
void main(float4 tc      : TEXCOORD0,
          out float4 color : COLOR,
          out float  depth : DEPTH)
{
    color = tc;
    depth = tc.x * 0.5;
}
